nded April 30, 2020.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Net Income\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Our net income increased by1,339,265 $ or 4,813.59%, to $ 1,311,454 for the six months ended April 30, 2021, from $-27,811 for the six months ended April 30, 2020. Such change was the result of the combination of the changes as discussed above.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  translation\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Our consolidated financial statements are expressed in U.S. dollars but the functional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of our operating subsidiaries is RMB. Results of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and cash flows are translated at average exchange rates during the period, assets and liabilities are translated at the unified exchange rate at the end of the period and equity is translated at historical exchange rates. Translation adjustments resulting from the process of translating the financial statements denominated in RMB into U.S. dollars are included in determining comprehensive income. Our foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  translation gain for the six months ended April 30, 2021 was $321,708, compared to a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  translation gain of $23,652 for the six months ended April 30, 2020, an increase of $298,056. The increased gain is primarily due to the appreciation of RMB against the U.S. dollars.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For the years ended October 31, 2020 and 2019\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The following table sets forth a summary of the Company's consolidated results of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for the years ended October 31, 2020 and 2019. The historical results presented below are not necessarily indicative of the results that may be expected for any future period.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                       