r for purposes of calculating mobile MAUs, although inaccuracy may result from the possibility that one mobile device may have more than one IP addresses; \u9679\'25\'CF 'monthly UVs' of MDMOOC website, MDMOOC.org, or the website of our Sunshine Health Forums, ygjkclass.com, are to the number of unique IP address that various internet browsers apply to access our websites, from either PC end or mobile end, at least once during a month. The numbers of our monthly UVs of our websites are calculated using internal company data that has not been independently verified, and we treat each distinguishable IP address as a separate user for purposes of calculating monthly UVs, although inaccuracy may result from the possibility that some individuals may have more than one IP address and/or share the same IP address with other individuals to access our platform. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'NFP(s)' refers to not-for-profit organizations. \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF 'SAIC' refers to \f28 \uc2 \f2 State Administration for Industry and Commerce\f28 \uc2 \f2  in China and currently known as State Administration for Market Regulation; \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Shanghai Huijing' refers to Shanghai Huijing Information Technology Co., Ltd., a PRC company. \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF 'Shanghai Jingyi' or 'Shanghai Zhongxin' refers to Shanghai Zhongxin Medical Technology Co., Ltd, a PRC company, which was formerly known as Shanghai Jingyi, or Shanghai Jingyi Medical Technology Co., Ltd., a PRC company and changed to its current name as Shanghai Zhongxin on November 16, 2020.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ii\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Shanghai Maidemu' refers to Shanghai Maidemu Cultural Communication Corp., a PRC company. \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Shanghai Xingzhong' refers to Shanghai Xingzhong Investment Management LP, a PRC company. \par       \par \f28 \