                                                       \par ITEM 17.       FINANCIAL STATEMENTS                                                           127 \par                                                                                               \par ITEM 18.       FINANCIAL STATEMENTS                                                           127 \par                                                                                               \par ITEM 19.       EXHIBITS                                                                       127 \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 i\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 INTRODUCTION\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Unless otherwise indicated, numerical figures included in this Annual Report on Form 20-F (the 'Annual Report') have been subject to rounding adjustments. Accordingly, numerical figures shown as totals in various tables may not be arithmetic aggregations of the figures that precede them.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For the sake of clarity, this Annual Report follows the English naming convention of first name followed by last name, regardless of whether an individual's name is Chinese or English. Numerical figures included in this Annual Report have been subject to rounding adjustments. Accordingly, numerical figures shown as totals in various tables may not be arithmetic aggregations of the figures that precede them. Certain market data and other statistical information contained in this Annual Report are based on information from independent industry organizations, publications, surveys and forecasts. Some market data and statistical information contained in this Annual Report are also based on management's estimates and calculations, which are derived from our review and interpretation of the independent sources listed above, our internal research and our knowledge of the PRC information technology industry. While we believe such information is reliable, we have not independently verified any third-party information and our internal data has not been verified by any independent source.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   All references to 'RMB,' 'yuan' and 'Renminbi' are to the legal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of China, all references to 'HKD' is to the legal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Hong Kong, and all references to 'USD,' and 'U.S. dollars' are to the legal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of the United States. \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'China' and 'PRC' refer to the People's Republic of China, excluding, for the purposes of this Annual Report only, Macau, Taiwan and Hong Kong; \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Class A Ordinary Shares' refers to our Class A ordinary shares, $0.0001 par value per share; \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Class B Ordinary Shares' refers to our Class B ordinary shares, $0.0001 par value per share; \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Controlling Shareholder' refers to Mr. Weiguang Yang, the CEO of the Company; \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   Depending on the context, the terms 'we,' 'us,' 'our company,' 'our', 'Zhongchao' and 'Zhongchao Cayman' refer to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Zhongchao Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 ., a Cayman Islands company, and its subsidiaries and affiliated companies; \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Horgos Zhongchao Medical' refers to Horgos Zhongchao Medical Technology Co., Ltd., a PRC company. \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Horgos Zhongchao Zhongxing' refers to Horgos Zhongchao Zhongxing Medical Technology Co., Ltd., a PRC company. \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF 'mobile MAUs' are the number of unique IP address that various mobile devices having access to our MDMOOC mobile app or Sunshine Health Forums from mobile end at least once during a month. The numbers of our mobile MAUs are calculated using internal company data that has not been independently verified, and we treat each distinguishable device IP address as a separate user for purposes of calculating mobile MAUs, although inaccuracy may result from the possibility that one mobile device may have more than one IP addresses; \u9679\'25\'CF 'monthly UVs' of MDMOOC website, MDMOOC.org, or the website of our Sunshine Health Forums, ygjkclass.com, are to the number of unique IP address that various internet browsers apply to access our websites, from either PC end or mobile end, at least once during a month. The numbers of our monthly UVs of our websites are calculated using internal company data that has not been independently verified, and we treat each distinguishable IP address as a separate user for purposes of calculating monthly UVs, although inaccuracy may result from the possibility that some individuals may have more than one IP address and/or share the same IP address with other individuals to access our platform. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'NFP(s)' refers to not-for-profit organizations. \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF 'SAIC' refers to \f28 \uc2 \f2 State Administration for Industry and Commerce\f28 \uc2 \f2  in China and currently known as State Administration for Market Regulation; \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Shanghai Huijing' refers to Shanghai Huijing Information Technology Co., Ltd., a PRC company. \par       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF 'Shanghai Jingyi' or 'Shanghai Zhongxin' refers to Shanghai Zhongxin Medical Technology Co., Ltd, a PRC company, which was formerly known as Shanghai Jingyi, or Shanghai Jingyi Medical Technology Co., Ltd., a PRC company and changed to its current name as Shanghai Zhongxin on November 16, 2020.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ii\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2   \u9679\'25\'CF   'Shanghai Maidemu' refers to Shanghai Maidemu Cultural 