statements.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The forward-looking statements contained in this report reflect our views and assumptions only as of the date this report is signed. Except as required by law, we assume no responsibility for updating any forward-looking statements.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ii\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 PART I\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Item 1. Identity of Directors, Senior Management and Advisers\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Not applicable for annual reports on Form 20-F.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Item 2. Offer Statistics and Expected Timetable\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Not applicable for annual reports on Form 20-F.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Item 3. Key Information\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A. Selected Financial Data\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The following table presents the selected consolidated financial information for our company. The selected consolidated statements of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and comprehensive income (loss) data for the three years ended December 31, 2020, 2019 and 2018, and the selected consolidated balance sheets data as of December 31, 2020 and 2019 have been derived from our audited consolidated financial statements, which are included in this annual report beginning on page F-1. Our historical results do not necessarily indicate results expected for any future periods. The selected consolidated financial data should be read in conjunction with, and are qualified in their entirety by reference to, our audited consolidated financial statements and related notes and 'Item 5. Operating and Financial Review and Prospects' below. Our audited consolidated financial statements are prepared and presented in accordance with US GAAP.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (All amounts in thousands of U.S. dollars, except Dividend per share in Renminbi and Shares outstanding)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                                    For the Years Ended December 31,   \par                                                