ses for each board of directors meeting attended, and any out-of-pocket expenses incurred by them in connection with their services provided in such capacity. We have entered into agreements with our directors Bin Cao, Fangjie Wang, Jialin Liu and Tingfu Xie. In addition, our director Wenjie Tang receives compensation for his service as an officer of the Company. He has not received and will not receive compensation as a director of the Company.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The table below indicates the compensations we paid to our board of directors in their capacity as directors for fiscal years 2020 and 2019:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Name                                                            Fiscal Year or Period            Salary($)              Bonus($)       StockAwards($)       All OtherCompensation($)         Total($)   \par Zhentao Jiang                                                                           2020                   -                       -                                               -                  -         -        \par Former Chairman of the Board(1)                                                         2019                   22,500                  0                                               0                  0         22,500   \par                                                                                                                                                                                                                              \par Bin Cao                                                                                 2020                   52,800                  0                                               0                  0         52,800   \par Chairman of the Board(1)                                                                2019                   31,500                  0                                               0                  0         31,500   \par                             